{"3940120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kevin's In Trouble", "steam_appid": 3940120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After encountering an inexplicable gravitational anomaly over an unknown, seemingly uninhabited planet, Kevin was unable to escape, and plummeted to the surface, where he was met with unusual hostile lifeforms. Stranded, and with no way to call for help, Kevin must fight his way through a geometric nightmare in hopes of restoring communications and finding a way off world. But is he strong enough to fend off the planet's forces?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash land into a chaotic bullet heaven, where you build a powerful deck to defeat hordes of hostile enemies and cripple their bosses, in hopes of making it home alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940120/extras/a4098d8daa12a8b97436b9288956eafe.avif?t=1786883156\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940120/extras_big/a4098d8daa12a8b97436b9288956eafe.webp?t=1786883156 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Deck Building:</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft the perfect deck from a growing collection of weapons, perks, and more. Discover new cards and powerful synergies to thwart the attackers and give Kevin the upper hand. Purchase valuable upgrades with the gold you acquire along the way to unleash maximum chaos against anything standing in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940120/extras/e2fde6e77d0626ed85b49528f926cea7.avif?t=1786883156\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940120/extras_big/e2fde6e77d0626ed85b49528f926cea7.webp?t=1786883156 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Challenging Enemies &amp; Bosses:</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle waves of challenging enemies with unique behaviors and attacks. Survive long enough to go toe-to-toe with the many bosses that rule over the planet and seek to destroy its intruders. With each boss, you'll need to adapt to a new set of deadly attacks if you want to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940120/extras/e664304546fee3bbb2900172997d3799.avif?t=1786883156\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940120/extras_big/e664304546fee3bbb2900172997d3799.webp?t=1786883156 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After encountering an inexplicable gravitational anomaly over an unknown, seemingly uninhabited planet, Kevin was unable to escape, and plummeted to the surface, where he was met with unusual hostile lifeforms. Stranded, and with no way to call for help, Kevin must fight his way through a geometric nightmare in hopes of restoring communications and finding a way off world. But is he strong enough to fend off the planet's forces?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash land into a chaotic bullet heaven, where you build a powerful deck to defeat hordes of hostile enemies and cripple their bosses, in hopes of making it home alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940120/extras/a4098d8daa12a8b97436b9288956eafe.avif?t=1786883156\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940120/extras_big/a4098d8daa12a8b97436b9288956eafe.webp?t=1786883156 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Deck Building:</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft the perfect deck from a growing collection of weapons, perks, and more. Discover new cards and powerful synergies to thwart the attackers and give Kevin the upper hand. Purchase valuable upgrades with the gold you acquire along the way to unleash maximum chaos against anything standing in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940120/extras/e2fde6e77d0626ed85b49528f926cea7.avif?t=1786883156\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940120/extras_big/e2fde6e77d0626ed85b49528f926cea7.webp?t=1786883156 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Challenging Enemies &amp; Bosses:</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle waves of challenging enemies with unique behaviors and attacks. Survive long enough to go toe-to-toe with the many bosses that rule over the planet and seek to destroy its intruders. With each boss, you'll need to adapt to a new set of deadly attacks if you want to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940120/extras/e664304546fee3bbb2900172997d3799.avif?t=1786883156\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940120/extras_big/e664304546fee3bbb2900172997d3799.webp?t=1786883156 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Fight your way through unrelenting waves of enemies in this top-down roguelite deckbuilding bullet heaven. Build and upgrade your deck with powerful weapons and perks to survive the gauntlet, defeat the bosses, and escap